BEHAVIOR fnv1a

DESCRIPTION
  64-bit FNV-1a hash of the first len bytes of data. Offset basis
  cbf29ce484222325 (hex), prime 100000001b3 (hex); 64-bit wrapping arithmetic
  (the result is the raw 64-bit pattern, so it reads back as a signed int).
  Empty input yields the offset basis.

CONTRACT
  INPUT data bytes 65536
  INPUT len int 8
  OUTPUT hash int 8
  GUARANTEES pure no_alloc writes_output

HASH b1b0b5ec

IMPLEMENTATION
  lenv = LOAD len 8
  h = -3750763034362895725
  i = 0

  LABEL loop
    done = IGE i lenv 8
    BRANCH done fin body
  LABEL body
    b = LOAD data 1 i
    bu = AND b 255 8
    h = XOR h bu 8
    h = IMUL h 1099511628211 8
    i = IADD i 1 8
    JUMP loop

  LABEL fin
    STORE hash h 8
END
